<title>USA: CNB Financial Corp Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>CNB Financial Corp Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CANAJOHARIE, N.Y. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.44		    $0.40</p>
<p> Net			  1,697		    1,629</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.81		    $1.63</p>
<p> Net			  7,157		    6,572</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Per share figures are adjusted to reflect a three-for-two stock split, which occurred January 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Total assets at the end of the 1996 fiscal year were $579.79 million versus $556.17 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
